## Running Smoke Tests Across Environments

```bash
# run all base and preset smoke tests for {{ spec.name }} across built-in environments
uv run pytest tests/cdm_data_loaders/pipelines/test_pipeline_smoke_spec.py --smoke-pipeline {{ spec.name }}
{% for preset in spec.presets %}

# run only the {{ preset }} preset subclass smoke tests
uv run pytest tests/cdm_data_loaders/pipelines/test_pipeline_smoke_spec.py --smoke-pipeline {{ preset }}
{% endfor %}

# run against a custom environment directory (config.toml, secrets.toml, settings.toml)
uv run pytest tests/cdm_data_loaders/pipelines/test_pipeline_smoke_spec.py \
    --smoke-pipeline {{ spec.name }} \
    --dlt-config-dir /path/to/env_dlt_config \
    --settings-file /path/to/env_dlt_config/settings.toml
```

